  "label": "Representation of people of color in educational media",
  "description": "The image and text together rely on the cultural understanding that people of color — particularly young women — are increasingly represented in educational and professional contexts in media. This representation is often used to challenge stereotypes or to affirm diversity. The meme’s positive intent depends on the viewer’s awareness of this broader cultural trend, which is not visible in the image itself.",
